{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bedrotting Simulator</strong> is a survival horror resource management game about modern paranoia, doomed love, and ancient spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18-year-old Sadie Bryggs lives alone - at least for now - and must balance her collapsing relationship, her sanity, and her survival. Scrape up cash online, board doors, lay traps, and uncover hidden tools in your apartment while demons close in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over the course of 10 nights you must fortify your home, fend off freakish enemies, and spend a <strong>lot</strong> of time in bed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963500/extras/a0c6e5158836c8331192a7d5ad9116fd.poster.avif?t=1756931533\" width=780 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963500/extras/a0c6e5158836c8331192a7d5ad9116fd.webm?t=1756931533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963500/extras/a0c6e5158836c8331192a7d5ad9116fd.mp4?t=1756931533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bedrotting Simulator features several different apps that serve different purposes, both on your computer and your phone. Browse increasingly bizarre social media feeds for encrypted messages, survival tips, and sanity boosts. Speedrun games to earn cash for upgrades and defenses - but beware of what you find online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963500/extras/da35392dfff9ebc1b7b6e246de55b3ca.poster.avif?t=1756931533\" width=780 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963500/extras/da35392dfff9ebc1b7b6e246de55b3ca.webm?t=1756931533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963500/extras/da35392dfff9ebc1b7b6e246de55b3ca.mp4?t=1756931533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your e-girlfriend Zoey happy - or don\u2019t. Brush aside your (many) differences in attempts to avoid breaking up at all costs. Navigate branching dialogue, lasting decisions, and personal issues that can change your relationship over just a few days. How much will you prioritize her? And how much inane Anime conversation can you withstand?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963500/extras/e6441118e8204f71e0029962f977ec2f.poster.avif?t=1756931533\" width=780 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963500/extras/e6441118e8204f71e0029962f977ec2f.webm?t=1756931533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963500/extras/e6441118e8204f71e0029962f977ec2f.mp4?t=1756931533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off demons with unique attack patterns, strengths, and designs. Research their weaknesses on cursed websites, build defenses, and fight to make it through each night. Over the course of the game, stronger and more complicated monsters are introduced, requiring intense multitasking and an extremely keen eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every choice matters - and your relationship, your sanity, and your life on the line.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepag