tras/e6441118e8204f71e0029962f977ec2f.mp4?t=1756931533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off demons with unique attack patterns, strengths, and designs. Research their weaknesses on cursed websites, build defenses, and fight to make it through each night. Over the course of the game, stronger and more complicated monsters are introduced, requiring intense multitasking and an extremely keen eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every choice matters - and your relationship, your sanity, and your life on the line.</strong></p>","developers":["ixavon"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963500/b570b8d72cab3a3e9d316920ad75a54a306708c7/header.jpg?t=1756931533","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3963500/596192799/a92974c7dd2bc31d7337f5a64a302a0c63b1cc3f/1756784772/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756785644","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3963500/596192799/a92974c7dd2bc31d7337f5a64a302a0c63b1cc3f/1756784772/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756785644","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3963500/596192799/a92974c7dd2bc31d7337f5a64a302a0c63b1cc3f/1756784772/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756785644","id":257189569,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189569/movie480.mp4?t=1756785644","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189569/movie_max.mp4?t=1756785644"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257189569/79e0eba843e8717845b71d2d7098377fd2fda982/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756785644","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189569/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756785644","max":"https://video.akamai.st