.jpg?t=1756931533","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963500/8235ea54d424312a29790a40b2a060c7258030c5/ss_8235ea54d424312a29790a40b2a060c7258030c5.600x338.jpg?t=1756931533"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963500/07969e269045fa8c5c97798d6bc3ce985d058de3/ss_07969e269045fa8c5c97798d6bc3ce985d058de3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756931533","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963500/07969e269045fa8c5c97798d6bc3ce985d058de3/ss_07969e269045fa8c5c97798d6bc3ce985d058de3.600x338.jpg?t=1756931533"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963500/08db0c419ce9d7e7a9b1e5ee317fc4fee8f751ec/ss_08db0c419ce9d7e7a9b1e5ee317fc4fee8f751ec.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756931533","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963500/08db0c419ce9d7e7a9b1e5ee317fc4fee8f751ec/ss_08db0c419ce9d7e7a9b1e5ee317fc4fee8f751ec.600x338.jpg?t=1756931533"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963500/6f4b6cd8d816de9901cad0c1c14b083eee31f854/ss_6f4b6cd8d816de9901cad0c1c14b083eee31f854.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756931533","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963500/6f4b6cd8d816de9901cad0c1c14b083eee31f854/ss_6f4b6cd8d816de9901cad0c1c14b083eee31f854.600x338.jpg?t=1756931533"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963500/a97a1f342afa3a84f68596ebe818cf1b3d75ea21/ss_a97a1f342afa3a84f68596ebe818cf1b3d75ea21.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756931533","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963500/a97a1f342afa3a84f68596ebe818cf1b3d75ea21/ss_a97a1f342afa3a84f68596ebe818cf1b3d75ea21.600x338.jpg?t=1756931533"}],"short_description":"Argue, comfort, and compromise to keep your e-girlfriend from leaving - then scramble to barricade doors, set traps, and fight off demons invading your apartment. Balance tense late-night calls with desperate defenses, and find out what breaks first: the walls around you, or your relationship.","steam_appid":3963500,"support_info":{"email":"ixavsigler@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}